# {{projectName}}

{{description}}

Built with pasha CLI — **CQRS (Axon Framework)** architecture on Spring Boot.

## Stack

- **CQRS:** Axon Framework 4.9
- {{#if ormJpa}}- **ORM:** JPA / Hibernate{{/if}}
{{#if ormMybatis}}- **ORM:** MyBatis{{/if}}
{{#if ormNone}}- **Data layer:** in-memory repositories{{/if}}
{{#if hasDatabase}}- **Database:** {{database}}{{/if}}
{{#if hasValidation}}- **Validation:** Jakarta Bean Validation{{/if}}
{{#if useRedis}}- **Cache:** Redis{{/if}}
{{#if hasBroker}}- **Messaging:** {{broker}}{{/if}}

## Run

```bash
cp .env.example .env
{{#if useDocker}}
docker compose up -d
{{/if}}
./mvnw spring-boot:run
```

The app starts at `http://localhost:8080`.

{{#if useSwagger}}
API docs at `http://localhost:8080/docs`
{{/if}}
{{#if dbH2}}
H2 console at `http://localhost:8080/h2-console` (JDBC URL: `jdbc:h2:mem:{{projectName}}`)
{{/if}}

## Modules

{{#each modules}}
- `{{this}}` → `http://localhost:8080/{{this}}`
{{/each}}

## Structure

```
src/main/java/com/example/project/
├── Application.java                    ← entry point
├── errors/                             ← global error handling
├── shared/                             ← cross-cutting concerns
├── command/<module>/                   ← write side
│   ├── Create<Module>Command.java
│   ├── Update<Module>Command.java
│   ├── Delete<Module>Command.java
│   └── <Module>Aggregate.java
├── event/<module>/                     ← domain events
│   ├── <Module>CreatedEvent.java
│   ├── <Module>UpdatedEvent.java
│   └── <Module>DeletedEvent.java
├── query/<module>/                     ← read side
│   ├── Find<Module>Query.java
│   ├── FindAll<Module>sQuery.java
│   ├── <Module>Projection.java
│   └── <Module>QueryHandler.java
└── controller/<module>/                ← REST API
    ├── <Module>Controller.java
    └── <Module>Dto.java
```

## Commands

```bash
./mvnw spring-boot:run              # dev server on :8080
{{#if useDocker}}
docker compose up -d                # start databases/brokers
docker compose down
{{/if}}
{{#if useCheckstyle}}
./mvnw checkstyle:check             # lint
{{/if}}
{{#if useTests}}
./mvnw test                         # run tests
{{/if}}
```

